  "title": "Neo-Concept International Group Holdings Limited Announces Pricing of Approximately US$8.1 Million Public Offering of Class A Ordinary Shares",
  "summary": "Hong Kong, Feb. 09, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Neo-Concept International Group Holdings Limited (Nasdaq: NCI) (the “Company”), a one-stop apparel solution services provider, today announced the pricing of its public offering on February 9, 2026 of 14,850,000 Class A ordinary shares at a public offering price of $0.5454 per Class A ordinary share (the “Offering”). […]",
